      ms: 9320
      voice: gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy
    '|b||A new monopoly earns $10 million a year in profit, and its deadweight triangle is $5 million. Rivals can freely compete to own it. Up to how much could it cost society each year?':
